---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { supabaseUrl } from "../lib/supabase-public";
const termsPreview = `${supabaseUrl}/storage/v1/object/public/materuni-images/waterfall_image/1791601414950-ew7ak42gjka.jpg`;
---
<SiteLayout title="Booking Terms & Conditions | Materuni Hosts" description="Review Materuni Hosts booking requests, per-person prices, availability, payment arrangements, transport and practical conditions before your visit." preloadImage={termsPreview}>
<section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow" data-i18n="terms_eyebrow">BEFORE YOU BOOK</span><h1 data-i18n="terms_title">Simple, clear booking terms.</h1><p data-i18n="terms_intro">What to expect when planning a Materuni experience with a local host.</p></section>
<section class="section legal-copy">
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_booking_title">Booking requests & reply-time promise</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_booking_body">Submitting the form sends an enquiry; it does not create a confirmed reservation. A local host will review the requested experience, date, group size and practical details, then contact you to confirm availability and the final arrangements. Response times may vary with local operating conditions.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_prices_title">Prices & group discounts</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_prices_body">Published experience prices are shown in US dollars per person. Inclusions vary by experience and are listed on the relevant page. Any group rate, additional activity or special arrangement must be confirmed by your host in writing. The equivalent in Tanzanian shillings is confirmed using the prevailing rate before payment.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_transport_title">Door-to-door transport & private transfers</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_transport_body">Transport is arranged separately unless a specific experience page or written quotation says otherwise. Share your hotel, airport or preferred pickup point when enquiring. Your host will confirm whether a transfer can be arranged, the vehicle details, journey estimate and separate price before you accept.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_deposit_title">Deposits & payment timing</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_deposit_body">The website currently collects booking enquiries and does not accept card payments. An enquiry does not require a deposit. If a deposit or other payment is required for a confirmed arrangement, your host will provide the amount, due date, accepted payment method and refund conditions in writing. Review and agree to those details before sending money. Do not pay to an account or number that has not been confirmed by Materuni Hosts.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_changes_title">Cancellation & refund policy</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_changes_body">We understand travel plans can shift. We offer a transparent, fair cancellation policy:</p>
  <p>Cancellation deadlines, any applicable fees, refund amounts and rescheduling options depend on the confirmed arrangement. Your host must provide the applicable cancellation and refund terms in writing before you make a payment. If you have not received them, ask for them before paying.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_weather_title">Weather guarantee & trail conditions</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_weather_body">Weather, trail conditions and water levels can change. If conditions are unsafe, your guide may recommend changing the route, modifying the activity or rescheduling. Any refund or price adjustment will follow the terms confirmed in writing for your booking. Your host will explain the available options before a change is accepted.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_safety_title">Experience conditions & safety</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_safety_body">Some trails include walking on uneven, moist, or sloping forest paths. We recommend sturdy walking shoes or hiking sneakers, a rain layer, and sun protection. Swimming in the waterfall pool is refreshing and permitted when water levels are calm and your guide approves. Please advise us in advance of any dietary requirements, allergies, or mobility considerations.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_children_title">Children & family visits</h2>
  <p data-i18n="terms_children_body">Children of all ages are welcome in Materuni! The village coffee tour, cultural dance, and cooking classes are family favorites. For the waterfall hike, children under 10 should be accompanied by an adult as the forest trail has gentle rocky sections.</p>
  <h2>Website content, copyright and permitted use</h2>
  <p>Unless a page or item states otherwise, website text, original branding, design elements and materials created for Materuni Hosts are protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. You may view and share links to public pages for personal, non-commercial reference. You must not republish, sell, modify or systematically extract website content, photographs, branding or other materials without prior written permission from the relevant rights holder. Third-party names, marks and media remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
  <h2>Website information and third-party services</h2>
  <p>Website information is provided to help guests plan an enquiry. Availability, itinerary details, inclusions, transport and final prices are confirmed individually by Materuni Hosts before a booking is accepted. External websites and service providers operate under their own terms and privacy notices; we are not responsible for content or services outside our control.</p>
  <h2>Applicable law and disputes</h2>
  <p>These website terms are intended to be read consistently with the laws applicable to the services supplied from Tanzania. Nothing in these terms removes consumer rights that cannot lawfully be excluded in the country where a guest resides. Any mandatory jurisdiction or dispute-resolution rules that apply will prevail. Obtain local legal review before relying on this wording as a formal contract.</p>
  <p><strong>Website content notice:</strong> © 2026 Materuni Hosts. All rights reserved, subject to the rights of third-party content owners.</p>
  <h2 data-i18n="terms_contact_title">Contact</h2>
  <p>For booking questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@materunihosts.com">hello@materunihosts.com</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/255612068540">+255 612 068 540</a>.</p>
  <p class="muted legal-updated">Last updated: 15 October 2026.</p>
</section>
</SiteLayout>
